{"symbol":"MEDCL.PA","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:31:33Z","info":{"address1":"3, rue des Frères Lumière","city":"Jacou","zip":"34830","country":"France","phone":"33 4 67 02 13 67","website":"https://www.medincell.com","industry":"Biotechnology","industryKey":"biotechnology","industryDisp":"Biotechnology","sector":"Healthcare","sectorKey":"healthcare","sectorDisp":"Healthcare","longBusinessSummary":"MedinCell S.A. engages in the research and development of biodegradable polymer-based processes for the controlled and prolonged delivery of active pharmaceutical ingredients into the human body and animals in France. The company offers UZEDY, a subcutaneous risperidone for the treatment of schizophrenia. It also develops mdc-TJK, a subcutaneous injection, which is in NDA stage for the treatment of schizophrenia; and mdc-CWM, a sustained-release formulation of celecoxib, which is in Phase III clinical trial for the treatment and reduction of post-operative pain and inflammation. In addition, the company engages in the development of products in preclinical stage, including mdc-WWM for contraception; mdc-STM for the treatment of malaria; and mdc-AbbVie-1. It has strategic collaborations with TEVA, AIC, ABBVIE, Unitaid, and Gates Foundation. The company was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in Jacou, France.","fullTimeEmployees":141,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Christophe  Douat","age":59,"title":"CEO & Director","yearBorn":1966,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":605482,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Stephane  Postic","title":"Chief Financial Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Philippe  Moyen","title":"Chief Operating Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Julie  Alimi","title":"General Counsel & Chief Corporate Development Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"n